[{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"瑶天回不极，杲日丽常悬。\n道器知宗本，心机会转旋。\n吸精蝉饮露，换骨鹤凌烟。\n空法声闻悟，金心色相宣。\n五神融五岳，三脉配三川。\n一入长生路，慈航理白筌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"五福宗洪范，三灵会洛书。\n璿玑回气马，华盖转云车。\n法象臻玄理，神光合太虚。\n阳春生螮蝀，阴魄长蟾蜍。\n精卫知填海，奸雄会剥卢。\n星官垂剑术，按法早行诛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"大言惊宇宙，小隐适山林。\n观世壶中静，知机象外深。\n洞文开万卷，绛岭历千寻。\n雄心沉白水，锐气炼黄金。\n谒圣玄宫里，寻仙苍木阴。\n未能挥宝剑，聊用抚瑶琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其六","author":"沈鍊","text":"浩浩虚无里，巍巍象帝先。\n玉台凌万丈，琪树历千年。\n已识龙车迈，还逢鹤驾翩。\n凌神游桂岭，当夕下芝田。\n啸月开书坐，乘云抱笛眠。\n欢情饶物外，本为世中怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其七","author":"沈鍊","text":"曾跨青霄鹤，来听碧树鸡。\n莲花从火发，桂叶与云齐。\n目旷乾坤小，身高日月低。\n壶中双凤隐，剑外六龙迷。\n药性因明启，丹功自敬跻。\n崆峒何用访，于此识端倪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其八","author":"沈鍊","text":"忏悔从心起，修持自道生。\n七签书日展，六甲义时明。\n伏虎风常寂，降龙电自横。\n金箱图北岳，玉局运南征。\n造化壶中转，星辰掌上行。\n神仙无所语，一曲颂升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其九","author":"沈鍊","text":"道士鍊真文，天机隐白云。\n神兵朱火出，圣化玉泉分。\n铸鍊昆吾剑，驱驰太乙军。\n四蹄齐马队，两翼奋鹅群。\n灵气千秋震，威名万里闻。\n旄头星气薄，雉尾日华曛。\n秘法参玄妙，谁能献圣君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十","author":"沈鍊","text":"一法齐王化，千灵肃圣筵。\n庄严安宇宙，变化转山川。\n玄圃人间辟，神洲陆地旋。\n玉麟心出世，丹凤气冲天。\n药自玄中得，兵从象外传。\n足摩三岛窟，手拂五云鞭。\n八极游无碍，纵横狎水仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十一","author":"沈鍊","text":"道自心灵悟，机因物象生。\n玄风流日用，妙理在常行。\n神气超无极，精微合有情。\n玉藏山自润，珠在水还明。\n松子非难学，王乔本易成。\n何人寄丹诀，白日试飞升。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十二","author":"沈鍊","text":"非无金鼎诀，自少碧山游。\n韩生骑白鹿，老子跨青牛。\n余亦邀玄鹤，相将访十洲。\n遐哉寻玉洞，邈矣度丹丘。\n因笑陶贞白，何须不下楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十三","author":"沈鍊","text":"大圣摛言密，神仙立意高。\n明心神不变，知命意先豪。\n要领参麟角，精微入兔毛。\n三才披道奥，六籍悟真韬。\n世泰登金马，时危命宝刀。\n文章藏石室，不必著离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十四","author":"沈鍊","text":"轩黄方好道，我本列仙才。\n每过蓬莱岛，曾上凌云台。\n非无远游意，自多尘世哀。\n眷风回玉管，夜月隐金罍。\n将军营细柳，宰相调盐梅。\n丹砂即经济，宝鼎谁能开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十五","author":"沈鍊","text":"将门应学道，仙法自通兵。\n宝剑神灵授，真符虎豹行。\n仁风随后殿，浩气是先声。\n义动三光合，机深五岳倾。\n本心期济世，谁羡列侯名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十六","author":"沈鍊","text":"神仙应治世，辅弼自须才。\n玉殿重门启，丹宫复道开。\n三花明户席，八桂隐樽罍。\n尧让夔龙入，轩聪后牧来。\n知人千载备，得一万方回。\n南极星光见，遥知接上台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十七","author":"沈鍊","text":"九州通水府，八宝丽金华。\n洞门飞紫气，此是上仙家。\n济世皆真诀，安民即道葩。\n琴书消日月，衣带结烟霞。\n萧史堪乘凤，张骞久泛槎。\n年年餐玉粒，几日发三花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十八","author":"沈鍊","text":"龙驭皆英杰，麟骖即大贤。\n访丹先得道，问药可成仙。\n敬士开云馆，迎宾敞日筵。\n二桃非秘术，五鼎是长年。\n元圣宁无德，垂情渭水边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其十九","author":"沈鍊","text":"神藻生常识，玄机即迩言。\n听聪通四耳，悬解彻三门。\n画璧图仙史，彤箫折道论。\n真风平地起，妙理匹夫存。\n野鸽犹传法，游鱼亦讯諠。\n音从万象起，观世得心源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其二十","author":"沈鍊","text":"上界非无事，中天亦有人。\n一元通大象，万品不离尘。\n驭世多龙女，璇玑并斗身。\n法华开玉树，心镜转金轮。\n何用求方外，惟须念玉真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其二十一","author":"沈鍊","text":"谁诵洞灵文，朱篇绿字芬。\n龙蛇象外隐，科斗画中分。\n苍颉精研得，轩辕睿思闻。\n杀机天地发，祗用建人群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其二十二","author":"沈鍊","text":"玄化垂真诀，仙机在席端。\n至人心洞达，妙道日盘桓。\n应世神无碍，调身理自安。\n冲虚神气守，澹荡百灵欢。\n变处风云起，开来宇宙宽。\n凌霄持一剑，谁为辟邪难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步虚词二十三章 其二十三","author":"沈鍊","text":"真人怡寝息，灏气日流行。\n万方心不挂，一贯理真明。\n宇宙机偏合，烟霞梦不惊。\n道摩疴自去，服食骨先轻。\n宝鼎风烟正，金壶滴漏清。\n华山曾羽化，留得五龙名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄奉陆宫保","author":"沈鍊","text":"将相兼权属上公，华夷交臂忆英䧺。\n金吾邸第开新府，虎卫韬钤迈古风。\n手握纲常为大孝，心存社稷是元功。\n指挥士马收河北，怅望烟尘到海东。\n不分曹瞒为逆贼，耻从魏绛学和戎。\n知时讵怕薰天势，仗义偏怀贯日忠。\n恩洽彤庭忻附凤，庆过清渭兆非熊。\n淹该谊与探囊并，敏捷机将破竹同。\n气作星辰长拱极，思如流水必朝宗。\n不辞玄叶千茎素，秖抱葵花一点红。\n宣父尊周文未丧，孔明辅汉意无穷。\n道高日月三灵上，名在乾坤万古中。\n一剑上方曾借得，擎天八柱倚崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同冯比部集贤膳部草堂得心字","author":"沈鍊","text":"兰馆樽初集，金门漏欲沉。\n清风七子赋，明月二难心。\n契好过逢数，欢娱燕笑深。\n马嘶芳草地，人醉落花阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月","author":"沈鍊","text":"明月东方出，关山正在西。\n愁闻蟾兔满，偏是照回溪。\n玉露含光重，金风带影低。\n讵令秋气爽，翻使戍心迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客行","author":"沈鍊","text":"从来好游侠，宝剑不曾离。\n白马驰长道，黄金报所知。\n风流倾斗酒，调笑折花枝。\n唯有燕云念，平生未肯移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集贤膳部草堂得荷字","author":"沈鍊","text":"秉烛过逢偶，乘閒引兴多。\n笛中传岸柳，香外泛池荷。\n道合簪偏聚，时清酒易酡。\n明朝问花事，风雨夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过谢四溟山房得香字","author":"沈鍊","text":"佳处景难忘，相逢再举觞。\n鸟疑曾识面，花已惯闻香。\n送目烟霞外，论心翰墨场。\n但教欢赏洽，随地有沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集孙子长草堂得园字","author":"沈鍊","text":"易遇双文玉，难逢一笑言。\n所嗟人似月，千里共黄昏。\n酌酒依金谷，题诗拟兔园。\n深欢不能别，翻觉重销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮张水部园中得琴字","author":"沈鍊","text":"霭霭辟疆心，言栖五亩阴。\n秋风行倚剑，晓月坐调琴。\n啼鸟歌偏剧，飞花舞不禁。\n从来台馆乐，未必胜园林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同吴膳部诸公会集草堂得周字","author":"沈鍊","text":"清人居水曲，明德象分流。\n世事多岐路，人心有道周。\n饮瓢怀耿洁，击楫抱殷忧。\n直恐风波满，谁能伤凛秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又得歌字","author":"沈鍊","text":"春色移庭树，知余系马多。\n相逢复不饮，其奈落花何。\n旷达轻欢燕，流连发浩歌。\n况同知己在，杯到讵蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏围棋","author":"沈鍊","text":"自将棋作世，谁为世如棋。\n日月枰中转，山河掌上移。\n雁飞教作阵，龙跃引成麾。\n满席天花坠，知余得意时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六桥堤上看美人走马","author":"沈鍊","text":"妖姬驰骏马，佳丽本相同。\n玉腕光摇辔，罗衣色映骢。\n汗流成腻露，尘起是香风。\n为借春光去，将心送落红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑一阳太医","author":"沈鍊","text":"郑公居谷口，炼药一阳成。\n剑外星辰迥，琴中山水生。\n门多三楚客，身在五湖行。\n为解探囊术，难逃世上名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈子先补增","author":"沈鍊","text":"陈琳试高等，章甫共兴歌。\n入夜犹吟诵，升堂事讲磨。\n析疑观日月，闻善决江河。\n嗟余迷学愿，因子悟盈科。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽刘孺人","author":"沈鍊","text":"孺人怀令德，内助有辉光。\n奕叶青袍贵，阶庭玉树芳。\n百年归夜室，五属奠春浆。\n积善流馀庆，诸孙不可忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄乐昌王殿下","author":"沈鍊","text":"迁客滞边州，回经万里秋。\n感时频仗剑，望远欲登楼。\n露下芙蓉湿，风生桂子浮。\n淮王池馆近，何日幸同游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军行","author":"沈鍊","text":"从军非必苦，游侠更为雄。\n七宝成双剑，三年造一弓。\n杀人沉海日，走马逐边风。\n意气怀明主，谁论万里功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄万鹿园总戎二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"玉帐东风入，春归细柳营。\n将军披羽服，挥麈坐谈兵。\n旗定辕门肃，香销燕室清。\n封侯非所愿，但遣四方平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄万鹿园总戎二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"楼船横汉水，五月渡天津。\n绝域回龙骑，清朝识虎臣。\n营中时校射，帐里夜邀宾。\n吹出梁州曲，还悲塞上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送施武陵之盐官丞","author":"沈鍊","text":"世皆卑道拙，余独叹才难。\n珥笔开千卷，抠衣博一官。\n戒行车骑急，饯别酒杯宽。\n吴会多山水，题诗好寄看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱县博赴武宁","author":"沈鍊","text":"余尝读功令，知重校官才。\n升堂鸣鹭鼓，释奠洗云罍。\n献赋嗟䧺等，明经是鼎来。\n诸生方引领，驱马莫徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马节推之庆远","author":"沈鍊","text":"莫以炎荒郡，非承明主恩。\n节旄千里重，轩盖百城尊。\n饮冰怀古道，仗剑出都门。\n白首心逾壮，知君是马援。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨进士小像","author":"沈鍊","text":"识面尚云易，知心良独难。\n谁能负奇气，长自被儒冠。\n丽藻凌云出，清光逼斗看。\n虎头应不偶，辛苦且加餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丘少府之浚县","author":"沈鍊","text":"绾绶佐专城，为郎已不轻。\n但能持节操，何惧少声名。\n折柳讵胜赠，看花在此行。\n怜君是知己，相许慰平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"息马论道","author":"沈鍊","text":"谁道驱驰地，翻为讲授筵。\n解鞍还作席，投辔别为弦。\n远驭轻千里，空行历九天。\n始知祠阙里，总胜勒燕然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得澹泉篇赠顾院使","author":"沈鍊","text":"本为金马客，却赏竹林泉。\n共说甘如醴，谁知淡是玄。\n洗心悬浩荡，漱齿啮云烟。\n世味余方苦，逢君意洒然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱提学赴闽中","author":"沈鍊","text":"选署抡才重，维藩典学尊。\n皇文今日丽，师道几人存。\n正色登三事，高名著五言。\n知君行万里，不负大夫轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李直夫还越","author":"沈鍊","text":"知子乐弦诵，从余陈蔡间。\n自因萱北发，将及雁南还。\n昔咏杯中月，今题马上山。\n知音已轻别，抱曲不须弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭君怨","author":"沈鍊","text":"贱妾罗衣薄，君王寝殿深。\n何须矜艳色，不自用黄金。\n马上千行泪，宫中一片心。\n琵琶弹不尽，总向玉关寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客行","author":"沈鍊","text":"北里新名侠，门多隐者车。\n问人寻宝剑，留客注丹书。\n七贵空闻姓，三公欲造庐。\n宁甘布衣老，不肯曳长裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得林中啼鸟","author":"沈鍊","text":"幽鸟园林迥，飞鸣本自珍。\n天机枝上晓，风韵叶边春。\n日暖和千弄，霜凄切一嚬。\n感时啼不歇，应有解言人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏同莫膳部过吴比部草堂论诗得中字","author":"沈鍊","text":"二仲既相逢，知余马首东。\n谁望千里外，还聚一堂中。\n对酒邀山月，论诗入国风。\n同声自相和，宁复叹飞蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日游将军射林莫子良后至以诗嘲之","author":"沈鍊","text":"相约出郊坻，兼逢重五时。\n世人皆赏节，吾党属题诗。\n射柳逢场暇，看花恨日迟。\n如何张孺子，偏后老人期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槐阴堂为沈开府赋","author":"沈鍊","text":"幕府近西墉，双槐夹院丛。\n槛垂浮叶外，帘捲落花中。\n舞处犹笼月，歌边不碍风。\n一樽从共饮，能折九边冲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送毛比部出守端州","author":"沈鍊","text":"毛公忻奉檄，讵是为专城。\n典郡怀明牧，分曹本硕卿。\n冰壶预为政，风月饯将行。\n千里蒙恩泽，一樽何厌倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周武选外补广东大参","author":"沈鍊","text":"珥笔中郎署，知君意气䧺。\n坐移芳桂月，参驭紫薇风。\n鼓枻三江外，看花百粤中。\n太平官事简，慎勿立奇功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁客曹定山犒师","author":"沈鍊","text":"郁郁三吴彦，名高属省臣。\n一为持节使，多少折梅人。\n行李图书出，鸣驺译象陈。\n还将怀远谊，荐作八方珍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张提学赴广东","author":"沈鍊","text":"虎观崇文日，鸿儒校士年。\n应知百粤地，不异五云天。\n柳借春风折，杯将北斗悬。\n送君临绛帐，吾道已恢然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23007,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送茌平县徐幕","author":"沈鍊","text":"我昔为兹县，君今是幕曹。\n相过新剑服，犹忆旧旌旄。\n要路迎逢剧，疲民抚字劳。\n但教持节苦，不用羡官高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23008,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张少府俵马还县","author":"沈鍊","text":"秋风起京国，何以送离人。\n最苦衣冠客，长驱道路尘。\n出门车马敝，还县簿书新。\n莫厌樽中酒，明朝潞水滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23009,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢山人吴比部重集草堂得青字","author":"沈鍊","text":"节序惊余老，壶樽对客醒。\n鬓看今岁白，眼向几人青。\n乐饮非河朔，悲歌是小星。\n扬䧺草玄处，何日燕然铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23010,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王明府赴灵壁","author":"沈鍊","text":"王子双凫舄，新辞五凤城。\n暂回抽笔兴，去作绾符行。\n客路依星署，官居学水清。\n泗滨多磬石，应和绮琴鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23011,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑郡幕赴兴化","author":"沈鍊","text":"山水推名郡，清才副幕寮。\n梅花知几树，应待朔风飘。\n行李悬双剑，壶餐奉一瓢。\n为官不厌苦，所至有风标。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23012,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄博士赴曲江","author":"沈鍊","text":"闻君岭表去，八桂动征鞍。\n迢递行千里，辛勤为一官。\n青云流绮席，杲日上朱纨。\n奉檄非无喜，功名在杏坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23013,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐县博赴繁昌","author":"沈鍊","text":"奉檄出河滨，行看柳色新。\n一官宁不贵，五斗秖因贫。\n绛帐樽中色，青毡马上尘。\n故乡云树近，早晚望慈亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23014,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]